# for the independently checked exact values. Written 2026-11-23.
# Sources: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# and fisher-l7f owner decisions. Written 2026-11-22.
> position fen 7k/6Q1/5K2/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> go
# Example for the owner to approve. The ticket cites Stockfish as a witness for checkmate.
< info depth 0 score mate 0
# Owner-approved example for checkmate. UCI move format spells the null move 0000.
< bestmove 0000
> position fen 7k/5K2/6Q1/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> go
# Example for the owner to approve. The ticket cites Stockfish as a witness for stalemate.
< info depth 0 score cp 0
# Owner-approved example for stalemate. UCI move format spells the null move 0000.
< bestmove 0000
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
